Build a modern, polished, responsive frontend for a college "Digital Notice Board" web application.

PROJECT CONTEXT:
This is a Cloud Computing college project. The final application will use:
- Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
- Backend: Node.js + Express.js
- Database: Azure SQL Database
- Deployment: Azure App Service

For now, ONLY build the frontend. Do not create a real backend or database. Use mock/sample data and structure the frontend so REST API integration can easily be added later.

APPLICATION NAME:
"CampusConnect – Digital Notice Board"

DESIGN GOAL:
Create a professional college notice-board dashboard that looks like a real production application, not a basic student project.

Use a clean modern UI with:
- Professional blue/indigo primary color
- White/light backgrounds
- Subtle gradients
- Rounded cards
- Soft shadows
- Good spacing
- Modern typography
- Smooth hover and transition animations
- Responsive design for desktop, tablet and mobile
- Accessible contrast and readable text

Do NOT overuse animations, glassmorphism, gradients or excessive colors. Keep the interface professional.

