IMPORTANT:
Create a clean service/API layer such as:

services/noticeService.js

The UI should call functions like:

getNotices()
getNoticeById(id)
createNotice(notice)
updateNotice(id, notice)
deleteNotice(id)

Initially these functions can use localStorage/mock data.

Later they will be replaced with calls such as:

GET /api/notices
GET /api/notices/:id
POST /api/notices
PUT /api/notices/:id
DELETE /api/notices/:id

Do NOT tightly couple UI components directly to mock data.

